  "notes": [
    "Wallets lists every wallet in this book. Wallets in other books are not included; a transfer to one of them appears as an external payment.",
    "Transactions lists every non-excluded transaction observed in the year. Excluded transactions are listed on the Excluded sheet and count nowhere else.",
    "Transaction Ref is Kassiber's id; Journal rows carry the same ref. Both legs of an own-wallet transfer or swap carry the same Pair Ref.",
    "Kassiber Classification is how the journal booked the row: internal_transfer moves between own wallets, swap is a reviewed conversion, income/acquisition/disposal cross the book's boundary, fee is a fee-only row. Source Kind is what the import or sync said.",
    "Amounts are in each asset's own unit. The (exact) columns are lossless text; sats columns are filled for BTC and L-BTC only. Net Change is signed: negative leaves the wallet.",
    "Money columns are in the book currency. Recorded Value is the cash amount recorded with the transaction (including exchange fees); Market Value is amount x price.",
    "Per-wallet cost basis is the asset's pooled residual basis allocated by quantity, as in portfolio-summary; the per-asset Roll-forward total is exact.",
    "Reconciliation compares journal balances with observed wallet movements at both ends of the year. A DIFF row needs an explanation before closing the books.",
    "Kassiber does not assign spheres, accounts, or the UGB/EA valuation rule. Tag rows in Kassiber to carry that assignment into this workbook."
  ]
}
